<div class="checklist">
    <h3>Checkpoint — before moving on, you must be able to:</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Break "the turret should not fire every frame" into its parts, and name the earlier lesson you lifted each one from</li>
        <li>Explain why your turret was firing once per frame, naming the line responsible</li>
