        <li>Explain why the refill line is mandatory, what bug returns without it, and why the tick is <code>timer -= Time.deltaTime</code> rather than <code>timer -= 1</code></li>
        <li>Say what the countdown does while the player is <em>outside</em> the radius, and whether that is what you want</li>
    </ul>
</div>

